<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_59999> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Frequently used for fluidic portions of matter and/or in the context of chemical reactions. Boundary to material not always sharp."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_59999> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical substance" .
