<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A measurement unit label is as a label that is part of a scalar measurement datum and denotes a unit of measure."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "measurement unit label"@en .
