<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A directive information entity that describes an action the bearer will take."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "action specification"@en .
