<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A label is a symbol that is part of some other datum and is used to either partially define  the denotation of that datum or to provide a means for identifying the datum as a member of the set of data with the same label"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "datum label"@en .
# 
